+// ── M9 Proof: Spindle Session as SexObject ────────────────────────────────────
+
+/// Run M9 Spindle session SexObject binding proof at boot.
+/// Activated by SEXOS_SPINDLE_SEXOBJECT_PROOF=1.
+///
+/// Spindle is a user-space app with no PDX server slots.  The session binding
